// A settings line longer than 511 bytes stays whole.
// A shorter line still drops trailing spaces.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE line ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG line law

IMPULSE line 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "line" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
